{"abstract":"This article applies Gray and Suri’s concept of Ghost Work and Ekbia and Nardi’s concept of Heteromation to the analysis of Quick, Draw!, a game-like product developed by Google. The article argues that digital capitalism uses the act of playing as an instrument to make exploitative labor practices feel more engaging, while camoufl aging their being work.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Sicart, Miguel Angel"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-381771"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Capitalist realism","Digital Play","Ghost Work","Heteromation","Machine learning","Platform Capitalism"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"playful capitalism or play as an instrument of capital","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.22409/contracampo.v40i2.50103","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-381771","ids":["itu-21a0faf8-947b-4b2b-ad56-6e6d0a0ae809"],"keyword":["Capitalist Realism","Digital Play","Ghost Work","Heteromation","Machine Learning","Platform Capitalism"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-21540942627275FE84A982EBE6D8074B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.22409/contracampo.v40i2.50103","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/86407985/50103_Texto_do_Artigo_181858_1_10_20211206.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":